      "preview": "חֶ֫לֶץ: nome próprio masculino; vigor.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֫לֶץ</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>vigor</em><strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  um dos heróis de Davi <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.26\">2 S 23:26</a>, 𝔊 Σελλης, A Ελλης, 𝔊L Χαλλης; = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.27\">1 Ch 11:27</a> 𝔊 Χελλης, 𝔊L Ελλης; também <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.10\">1 Ch 27:10</a> 𝔊 Χεσλης, A 𝔊L Χελλης (em ambos, Baer <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶלֶץ</span>, van d. H. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶץ</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  homem de Judá <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.39\">1 Ch 2:39</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חָ֑לֶץ</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.39\">39</a> 𝔊 Χελλης 𝔊L Αλλαν.",
