      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫לֶץ</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino</strong> ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֶ֫לֶץ\" href=\"/BDB,_חֶ֫לֶץ\", dir=\"rtl\">חֶלֶץ</a> acima.",
