      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חִלְקִיָּהוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חִלְקִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>minha porção é</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span><strong>)</strong> 𝔊 geralmente Χελκ(ε)ιας, Χελχιας;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  pai de Eliaquim, oficial de Ezequias, <span dir=\"rtl\">חלקיהו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.18\">2 K 18:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.20\">Is 22:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.3\">36:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.22\">22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חלקיה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:37\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.37\">2 K 18:37</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  sumo sacerdote, no tempo de Josias, <span dir=\"rtl\">חלקיהו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.4\">2 K 22:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.4\">23:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.9\">2 Ch 34:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.22\">22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חלקיה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.8\">2 K 22:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.39\">1 Ch 5:39</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.11\">9:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.8\">2 Ch 35:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:1\" href=\"/Ezra.7.1\">Ezr 7:1</a>, cf. também <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.11\">Ne 11:11</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חלקיהו</span> pai de Jeremias <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.1\">Je 1:1</a>.—Os seguintes são todos <span dir=\"rtl\">חלקיה</span>:<br><strong>4.</strong>  levitas: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.30\">1 Ch 6:30</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.11\">1 Ch 26:11</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  um sacerdote, contemporâneo de Esdras <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.8\">Ne 4:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.7\">12:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.21\">21</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  pai de Gemarias, um embaixador de Zedequias a Nabucodonosor <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.3\">Je 29:3</a>.",
